Z||000000||danny boy||04-23-2001||05:08 PM|||| Ok, not really. I just couldn't wait to say that.Anyway, I have a question. Right now my car has power mirrors.I have to replace both doors,pass side because of damage, driver side because of a flying jackstand (damn subframe bolts). The new doors do not have pwr mirrors. I can't remember ever using them anyway, so(and finally, the question!)should I keep them? For oohs and aahs maybe?  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||04-23-2001||06:31 PM||||Keep them!<P>All you have to do is re-route the mirror wire (it's on it's own seperate harness) through the grommet at the front of the door.  Roll down your windows and remove the seal that covers up an access hole just ahead of the interior door panel.  Removed the two nuts that hold the mirror to the door with a 10mm box end wrench.||||reg||1
